{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115818","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115818/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115818/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115818/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115818","id":3891097224,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7n7W6I","number":115818,"title":"The Inspector sets `Dictionary` properties while editing a new and not-yet-added entry","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-03T12:44:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T14:03:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4.6.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the inspector, new key/value pairs aren't added to the dictionary until we click `Add Key/Value Pair`. Yet the inspector still sets the property with the unchanged dictionary while editing the new values.\n\n<img width=\"339\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6eb8734d-ebc6-4f66-a828-251de65ae032\" />\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a tool resource script with a dictionary export and a setter.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nclass_name CellSet extends Resource\n\n\n@export var sources: Dictionary[int, int] = {0: 0, 1: 10, 2: 20}:\n\tset(value):\n\t\tsources = value\n\t\tprint(\"Dictionary size: %s\" % sources.size())\n\t\temit_changed()\n```\nCreate a new resource of this anywhere and edit the `sources` property.\nThis will print every time you edit the new key/value pair in the inspector, even if the dictionary itself is unchanged.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[dictionary_new_pair_set_2026-02-03_09-41-47.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25045845/dictionary_new_pair_set_2026-02-03_09-41-47.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115818/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115818/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}